. 
. *==============================================================
. * DETRENDING: fit a CA-specific linear trend on the pre-law years (post==0)
. * and keep the residuals. Same as Table 2 column (3) of Sophia's panel tables
> .
. *==============================================================
. gen ca_year = ca*fyr

. 
. reg lnmktcap ca fyeardum* ca_year if post==0, cluster(firm_id)
